      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "4. Such Agency shall request of the Temporary State Housing Rent Commission that all information, records and data in the possession of such Commission, relating to the regulation and control of residential rents and evictions in the City of New York be transferred to the City Rent Agency on May first, nineteen hundred sixty-two or as soon thereafter as may be practicable, and such Agency shall be authorized to receive and assume custody of all such information, records and data.",
